{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_10","type":"agent_message","text":"The core is single-retire, and MEM/WB clears its valid bit during holds, so it provides a once-only training event. I’ll use an eight-entry circular stack that resets occupancy and extend the existing prediction metadata through ID and OC without changing arithmetic or branch-direction recovery.\n"}}
