th a 199.837 ns, 156-cell worst path through forwarding and the execute\\nALU. The ALU expresses signed and unsigned division and remainder as four\\nseparate arithmetic expressions. These deep combinational arithmetic\\ncones are a strong candidate for the unusually low Fmax, and replicating\\nthem also creates placement and routing pressure in the 12,312-LUT design.\\nA comb\n…[147524 of 150596 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:5202d5b222a75bd4]…\n: \"test/test_ex_result.py\", \"description\": \"Compare each result class with independent RV32 integer and\\nreal/ALTOPS references, including signed comparison boundaries,\\nall shift amounts, modulo overflow and jump-link precedence.\\nRetain the existing complete ALU arithmetic and protocol suites.\\n\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 191.75, \"delta_pct\": -11.75, \"vs_baseline\": 1482.1, \"fmax_mhz\": 80.47, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4196601, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 4081, \"ff\": 1355, \"seeds\": [80.529, 80.47, 80.47], \"perturbations\": [[0, 80.529, 9], [1, 80.47, 9], [2, 80.47, 9]], \"lutram\": 8, \"bsram\": 6, \"dsp\": 6, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"dmem_3_dmem_3_0_0_s\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_ex/u_mul_predictor/narrow_product_31_s0\", \"slack_ns\": -7.418, \"arrival_ns\": 17.492, \"logic_cells\": 9, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_mem\", \"cpu/u_oc\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 9, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-05T09:33:59.250755Z\", \"slot\": 0, \"round_id\": 14}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
