o_opt attempts addressed combinational division and\\nredirect control; neither targets this remaining operand path.\\nNo LESSONS.md exists. A fresh unchanged Gowin build reproduces the\\nchampion's placement-option-0 result, 50.610 MHz and 3,000 logic cells.\\n\",\n  \"hypothesis\": \"Move PC-versus-rs1 and immediate-versus-rs2 operand preselection across\\nthe existing ID/EX register boundary, without adding a pipeline stage.\\nAdd two 32-bit fields to id_ex_t. On ordinary ID capture, alu_a_val\\nreceives dec_is_auipc ? fetch_pc : rs1_data and alu_b_val receives\\ndec_alu_src ? decoded_imm : rs2_data. Use the existing write-first\\nregister-file read data. Captu\n…[4322 of 7394 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:6c87e44975ff474e]…\n67 to 231 bits.\\nRetain every existing assertion. Add directed PC/immediate operand\\ncases with both forwarding stages matching aliased raw register\\nfields, true register dependencies on each source, and dmem/divider\\nholds. Check results, original RVFI operands, AUIPC PC, JALR target,\\nstore data, divide operands and monotonic retirement order.\\n\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"file\": \"test/test_ex_divider.py\",\n      \"description\": \"Extend ID_FIELDS with alu_a_val and alu_b_val after imm and populate\\nthem consistently when packing directed EX inputs. Retain every\\ncompletion, forwarding, downstream-hold and one-time-consume\\nassertion. Include a no-forwarding division that consumes the\\ncaptured operand fields as well as the existing forwarded case.\\n\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\nhyp-20261005-002-r3s1 structural regression 133.45 4389122 58.572 Move multiplication into a registered shared execution unit\nhyp-20261005-003-r3s2 predictor improvement 138.64 4201709 58.252 Narrow multiply-result prediction with full-width MEM validation\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
