mapped\n  resources and all three Gowin placement options. Keep every existing\n  correctness gate and require (Fmax_new/58.252)*(4201709/cycles_new)>1.046;\n  do not claim a win from eliminating BSRAMs or from unit tests alone.\nexpected_impact:\n  fitness_delta_pct: 6\n  confidence: low\nchanges:\n  - file: rtl/reg_file.sv\n    description: |\n      Force resettable flop storage using the vendor-supported registers\n      RAM-style attribute. Decode read addresses one-hot and fold bypass\n      into the masked-word OR reduction using shared per-word write\n      enables. Preserve synchronous reset priority, two combinational\n      ports, exact write-first semantics, x0, and all existing ports.\n      Inspect Gowin inference and timing instead of assuming that the\n      RTL attribute or selector shape improved frequency.\n  - file: test/test_reg_file.py\n    description: |\n      Retain all existing tests. Add deterministic randomized write/read\n      checks against an all-zero-reset reference model, both-port bypass,\n      bypass on one port while the other reads a different stored word,\n      every register address, x0 writes, and repeated resets after data\n      have been written. Check reset coincident with write enable and\n      first writes after reset to detect stale-word OR contributions.\n''')\nimport json,yaml,jsonschema\nh=yaml.safe_load(p.read_text())\njsonschema.validate(h,json.loads(Path('schemas/hypothesis.schema.json').read_text()))\nassert h['id']=='hyp-20261005-001-r5s0' and h['category']=='micro_opt'\nassert type(h['expected_impact']['fitness_delta_pct']) is int\nprint('Refined hypothesis written and schema validated.')\nPY\"", "aggregated_output": "Refined hypothesis written and schema validated.\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
