dation. Keep the existing rs2 store-data path, load extension and writeback, registered multiply repair/quarantine, divider cancellation, and branch/jump behavior. A waiting active request must remain stable for any length of dmem stall. Inactive bus addresses may diff\n…[3215 of 6287 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:3f373e0bf6595bc9]…\nr the added address field without weakening any\n    assertion. Preserve complete architectural and recovery coverage. Check effective addresses from both\n    forwarding sources, negative immediates, every load/store width, misalignment suppression, stable\n    active requests under repeated bus holds, divider draining and multiplication repair/quarantine.\n- file: test/test_ex_divider.py\n  description: Update the EX/MEM field layout used to unpack divider completions. Retain exact arithmetic,\n    source snapshots, unique emission, bus-hold and cancellation assertions; ensure the added field cannot\n    create memory effects for divider payloads.\n- file: test/test_mem_repair.py\n  description: Update standalone EX/MEM packing to include effective_addr and supply it for younger memory\n    operations. Retain every qualification, target, held-payload, quarantine and exact-product assertion;\n    use differing alu_result and effective_addr values to verify memory ports and alignment use only the\n    dedicated address.\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
