{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_111","type":"agent_message","text":"The parallel comparisons also lost timing. My final probe buffers each predictor update in a small registered record and bypasses it to prediction and training reads. That preserves the original counter values cycle by cycle while moving the table write off the late branch-outcome path."}}
