truct fields or explicit data/control\n  registers. Ensure synthesis cannot rebuild a squash-controlled mux\n  on any memory address or write-data register input. A bubble may carry\n  data bits, but valid=0, ctrl='0 and rd=0 disable all memory requests,\n  forwarding writes and re\n…[2595 of 5667 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:d35dc6ffc4e44617]…\neld downstream holds,\n      original divider snapshots, exact valid payloads and existing\n      suppression of younger launches, redirects and training.\n  - file: test/test_ex_divider.py\n    description: |\n      Retain every arithmetic, progress, completion and stall assertion.\n      Update only all-zero invalid-payload checks to require valid=0,\n      ctrl=0, rd=0 and disabled effects; assert exact field retention on\n      dmem holds and exact captured operands on divider consumption.\n      Cover older repair during launch and completed-result availability.\n  - file: test/test_pipeline.py\n    description: |\n      Retain all architectural and forwarding coverage. Add forced\n      multiply mismatches followed by loads, every store width, ALU,\n      branch, JALR and DIV/REM consumers, including bus stalls and an\n      older WB source. Assert zero wrong-path memory requests or\n      retirement, exact repaired product and RVFI operands, strict\n      order, one-shot replay and unchanged matching-MUL cycle counts.\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
