{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_76","type":"agent_message","text":"The four-entry queue with empty pass-through saved 5.34% of CoreMark cycles, but its measured fitness gain was only about 1.1%. I also found that Yosys discarded payloads stored as an array of packed structs in the formal probe. I’ve changed the proposed storage to flat packed bits and am checking the deeper queue and formal reachability."}}
