IVU, REM, and REMU datapaths with one\\nclocked radix-2 restoring divider, shared across all four operations.\\nCapture the fully forwarded operands and operation exactly once when a\\nvalid division instruction can start. Use registered divisor, quotient,\\nand 33-bit partial remainder; execute one trial subtraction and quotient\\nbit per cycle for 32 iterations. Register sign\n…[101351 of 104423 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:f24520e7dd300acc]…\nssues, filling during backend waits, load-use head retention, all control transfers and older multiply repair at varying occupancies. Check single retirement and no wrong-path memory effects or uncanceled divides; retain architectural coverage for real and ALTOPS products.\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 178.84, \"delta_pct\": 0.17, \"vs_baseline\": 1375.58, \"fmax_mhz\": 71.106, \"ipc_coremark\": 3e-06, \"cycles\": 3975958, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 3945, \"ff\": 1013, \"seeds\": [68.366, 71.106, 71.106], \"perturbations\": [[0, 68.366, 14], [1, 71.106, 14], [2, 71.106, 14]], \"lutram\": 57, \"bsram\": 4, \"dsp\": 6, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_mem/reg_q.alu_result_21_s0\", \"to\": \"dmem_1_dmem_1_0_0_s\", \"slack_ns\": -9.627, \"arrival_ns\": 19.922, \"logic_cells\": 14, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_wb\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu\", \"cpu/u_ex\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 14, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-05T04:42:57.479180Z\", \"slot\": 1, \"round_id\": 7}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
