egory\": \"micro_opt\", \"motivation\": \"The only recorded experiment is the baseline: 12.12 fitness at 5.442 MHz,\\nwith a 199.837 ns, 156-cell worst path through forwarding and the execute\\nALU. The ALU expresses signed and unsigned division and remainder as four\\nseparate arithmetic expressions. These deep combinational arithmetic\\ncones are a strong candidate for the unusually low Fmax, and replicating\\nthem also creates placement and routing pressure in the 12,312-LUT design.\\nA combinational divider optimization can improve clock frequency without\\nchanging CoreMark's cycle count or the pi\n…[321456 of 324528 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:3b2a4ce0ed0a3f47]…\nks.\\nAdapt readiness expectations for history misses and exercise WB fallback,\\nnearest producer blocking, retained sources, coherent store learning,\\nforced stale hits with every dependent consumer class, wrong-path stores,\\ncanceled divides, independent bus stalls and older multiplication priority.\\n\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 185.71, \"delta_pct\": -8.68, \"vs_baseline\": 1432.26, \"fmax_mhz\": 78.098, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4205263, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 4438, \"ff\": 1457, \"seeds\": [79.525, 78.098, 78.098], \"perturbations\": [[0, 79.525, 13], [1, 78.098, 11], [2, 78.098, 11]], \"lutram\": 8, \"bsram\": 8, \"dsp\": 6, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_oc/reg_q.rs2_val_0_s0\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_if/pc_12_s1\", \"slack_ns\": -7.575, \"arrival_ns\": 17.869, \"logic_cells\": 38, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu\", \"cpu/u_if\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 13, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-05T06:13:16.431704Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 9}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
