{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_22","type":"agent_message","text":"The trace comparison weakens the history-predictor case: the draft increases direction misses, and even perfect direction prediction appears to offer too little cycle savings alone. I’m testing partial load-value prediction next, since it could shorten the champion’s slow memory-to-operand path without the large tagged table used in the failed load predictor."}}
