cles 4201709 Narrow multiply-result prediction with full-width MEM validation\nhyp-20261005-001-r4s0 micro_opt regression 130.14 Fmax 54.679 cycles 4201709 Isolate memory address generation from the general ALU result\nhyp-20261005-002-r4s1 structural regression 126.86 Fmax 53.304 cycles 4201709 Register multiply repair and quarantine younger memory effects\nhyp-20261005-003-r4s2 predictor regression 130.99 Fmax 56.087 cycles 4281727 Predict the middle carry of EX arithmetic and validate full results in MEM\nhyp-20261005-001-r5s0 micro_opt regression 133.12 Fmax 55.932 cycles 4201709 Use a flop register file with word-local one-hot bypass reads\nhyp-20261005-002-r5s1 structural improvement 155.44 Fmax 65.311 cycles 4201709 Retime operand preparati\n…[53235 of 56307 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:aeed6ed54657ed3e]…\nremoving\ntwelve carry-propagation bits on the EX result-return path. This is an\nunmeasured arithmetic hypothesis, not a claim of an evaluated win. It\ndiffers from r4 by replacing the full EX arithmetic result with a narrow\nsign-extension candidate, using current registered older recovery and\nregistered OC operands, and leaving memory addresses exact in EX.\nRisks are exact MEM arithmetic becoming critical, added operand-register\nrouting, a remaining memory bypass limit, and replays on wide sums.\nProfile candidate mismatches and measure actual stalled cycles; modest\ndatapath shortening alone does not establish a fitness improvement.\n\nPreserve nret=1, every top-level port, exact RVFI operands/results/order,\ndecoder defaults, trap discipline, memory semantics and every hard\ninvariant. Run unchanged formal, unit suites, ready/stalled trace cosims,\ncanonical 2K CoreMark CRC/bracket/completion validation and median Gowin\ntiming. Acceptance requires (Fmax_new/91.186)*(4,196,601/cycles_new)>1.046.\n\nERROR None \nNOTES \n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
